From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Project Luma <engineering@projectluma.org>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 21:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: Cache the blurred backdrop and repaint only what
 changed

In Frost and Glass every Luma application window asks for a background
blur. Each time anything was drawn inside a blurred window's sampled area
(another window dragged over or beside it, a cursor-sized client update),
the redraw was widened to that window's whole sampled area: every window
beneath it was repainted across its full size, the full-resolution backdrop
was copied into freshly allocated textures and blurred again. With several
blurred windows stacked, each widening pulled in the next window's area, so
a small drag repainted most of both monitors on every frame.

Keep, per blurred surface and per monitor view, the backdrop at the
resolution the blur downscales to anyway. Framebuffer blocks repainted
beneath the surface this frame are copied into it; the rest is still valid,
because nothing outside the redraw changed. Blocks sit on a grid anchored to
the framebuffer origin, so partial updates are seamless. The blur then runs
on the small cached backdrop, and the redraw only grows by the damage plus
the blur's sampling reach instead of the surface's whole area. Textures are
reused while the surface keeps its size, so moving a blurred window no
longer allocates per frame.

The cache is rebuilt from a full repaint whenever the surface moves,
resizes, changes view scale or blur radius, or was culled on a frame that
changed its backdrop. Offscreen paints (screenshots, casts, effects) keep
the previous path unchanged. LUMA_MUTTER_BLUR_CACHE=0 turns the cache off
for A/B measurements. MUTTER_DEBUG=render logs each blurred paint (cached or
rebuilt, fresh pixels).
---
 clutter/clutter/clutter-blur-private.h  |   5 +
 src/backends/meta-stage-private.h       |   2 +
 src/backends/meta-stage.c               |  12 +
 src/compositor/meta-background-effect.c | 869 +++++++++++++++++++++++-
 src/compositor/meta-background-effect.h |   4 +-
 src/compositor/meta-surface-actor.c     |   9 +-
 6 files changed, 898 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

